            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchanïn ECHOTYON, “Kirkegh kungwïn Musa nko Samwel akughyongo tawunyan akïsaghanïn, mosyonchinanye pïchete kokay. Mwochinö kïpegha tawunyan, mochömanye osïwïye chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwato tepinyi lö kïpetecha onö, ilenchï kamwaghan ante ECHOTYON lö,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kamwaghan ante ECHOTYON lö otyorunan tïkwïn angwan cho ipu kinyarat. Otyorunan ngot nyo pörokwa nko kukïdin cho chutöy porwöyikwa nko töritwo yïm cho omöy porwöyikwa nko tïpö wudïn cho pkonöy kuwontoy panye cho köngötï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.1+2KI.21.2+2KI.21.3+2KI.21.4+2KI.21.5+2KI.21.6+2KI.21.7+2KI.21.8+2KI.21.9+2KI.21.10+2KI.21.11+2KI.21.12+2KI.21.13+2KI.21.14+2KI.21.15+2KI.21.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Pöy 21:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.1+2CH.33.2+2CH.33.3+2CH.33.4+2CH.33.5+2CH.33.6+2CH.33.7+2CH.33.8+2CH.33.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Ot 33:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oghan chane kïlïkwï pich ighöy paytaghtina ngwïny kïmïkul kwotyö ompö ngal cho kigh Manase wero Esekia ompö Yerusalem ato ki pöytoghinto Yuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
